<title>LITHUANIA: GRAFOBAL APRIL NET PROFIT 123,000 LITAS.</title>
<headline>GRAFOBAL APRIL NET PROFIT 123,000 LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian paper packaging producer Grafobal said on Monday that its net profit in April was 123,000 litas.  </p>
<p>The company's head of finances, Saulius Povilaitis, also told Reuters that its sales in April reached 2.42 million litas.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported that its first quarter net profit was 155,600 litas in sales of 6.5 million litas.</p>
<p>The company, which is 50 percent Slovak-owned, is traded on the A list of the Vilnius bourse.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
